    kanalAplikacije:"Apps", temaNaslov:"Appearance (theme)", temaOpis:"Pick a colour scheme. The default Safeer theme plus the five most widely used themes people know from other apps.", temaSafeer:"Default Safeer OS theme", temaIzbrana:"Selected", kanalLastniApi:"Own API", kanalLastniApiOpis:"If you have a token for your own app, enter it here – messages land in the shared inbox.", kanalApiIme:"Channel name (optional)", navMatrix:"Matrix (Element, Beeper, own Synapse): in Element open Settings › Help & About › Advanced › Access Token and paste it here. The server address is the one your account lives on (e.g. https://matrix.org).", navTelegramBot:"Telegram Bot: in Telegram message @BotFather, send /newbot and follow the steps – you get a token like 123456:ABC… The bot receives messages from people who write to it; Telegram does not expose your private account this way.", panoIskanje:"Search this person", panoIskanjePh:"Word in messages…", panoNiZadetkov:"No messages with that text.", kanalKjeImas:"Where is your e-mail? Pick the provider – Safeer knows the servers, you only enter the address and password.", kanalDrugPonudnik:"‹ Other provider", kanalDrugPonudnikIme:"Other provider", kanalDrugPonudnikOpis:"Type your address – we suggest the servers.", kanalNiNaVoljo:"not available", kanalNapredno:"Servers (advanced)", kanalKajNarediti:"What you need to do", kanalNaslovPri:"Your {ime} address", kanalGesloAplikacije16:"App password (16 characters)", kanalNavadnoGeslo:"Usual password", kanalAplikacijeOpis:"These providers only work through their own app. The official web version opens inside Safeer OS, or the official download page; Safeer downloads nothing itself.", kanalAppPosta:"E-mail", kanalAppKlepet:"Chat", kanalAppSplet:"Open in Safeer OS", kanalAppPrenos:"Download for computer",
    navGmail:"1. Open myaccount.google.com › Security and turn on 2-Step Verification.\n2. There, find “App passwords”, create one (name it e.g. Safeer) and copy the 16-character password.\n3. Enter your Gmail address and THAT password here (not your main one).\nIMAP is on by default in Gmail.", navYahoo:"1. Open login.yahoo.com › Account security › “Generate app password”.\n2. Copy the generated password and enter it here instead of your main one.\nThe username is your full Yahoo address.", navIcloud:"1. Open account.apple.com › Sign-In and Security › “App-Specific Passwords” (two-factor authentication required).\n2. Create one for Safeer and enter it here instead of your Apple Account password.\nThe address is your full iCloud address.", navGmx:"1. In webmail open Settings › POP3/IMAP and enable IMAP.\n2. Enter your address and your usual password here.", navZoho:"1. In Zoho Mail open Settings › Mail Accounts › “IMAP Access” and enable it.\n2. If two-factor authentication is on, create an “App password” in your Zoho account and enter that.", navFastmail:"1. In Fastmail open Settings › Privacy & Security › Integrations › “New app password” (for mail).\n2. Enter your address and that app password.", navArnes:"Enter your Arnes address and password. If sign-in fails, Safeer retries with the username without “@arnes.si” by itself.", navNavadno:"Enter your address and your usual mail password. Safeer knows the servers and ports. If sign-in fails, Safeer retries with the username without the domain by itself.", navOauth:"Microsoft no longer allows password sign-in for personal accounts (OAuth sign-in is required, which Safeer does not have yet). Until then use Outlook under the “Apps” tab.", navDrug:"Type your address – Safeer suggests imap.domain and smtp.domain. If your provider lists different servers, fix them under “Servers (advanced)”.",
